id=gms_millet_guard
name=Millet Guard
version=2.1.3
versionCode=213
author=E3N
summary=Configurable HyperOS Millet/Greeze no-restrict guard
description=Keeps user-selected apps in MILLET_NO_RESTRICT_APP. Includes Xiaomi GMS limiter handling, DNS-aware recovery, stale-MCS proactive heartbeat, heartbeat-transition recovery, reconnect self-healing, and narrow SwipeUpClean stopped-state repair.
